{"id":"5e8f3c4b1c542063","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-m-complete.md","title":"m-Complete","display":"df-m-complete — m-Complete","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-m-complete","aliases":["88-df-m-complete"],"display":"df-m-complete — m-Complete","depends_on":["[[88-df-many-one-reducible]]","[[88-df-ce-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-m-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-m-complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-m-complete — m-Complete"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"87fbc479272c5469\" href=\"?note=87fbc479272c5469\" title=\"88-df-many-one-reducible\">88-df-many-one-reducible</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\">\\(A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (set of natural numbers, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\)</span> (computably enumerable predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_m\">\\(\\leq_m\\)</span> (many-one reducible, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"87fbc479272c5469\" href=\"?note=87fbc479272c5469\" title=\"88-df-many-one-reducible\">88-df-many-one-reducible</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}m\\text{-}complete} \\vdash \\mathrm{m\\text{-}Complete}(A) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{CE}(A) \\land \\forall B\\subseteq\\mathbb{N}\\;(\\mathrm{CE}(B)\\to B\\leq_m A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}m\\text{-}complete} \\vdash \\mathrm{m\\text{-}Complete}(A) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{CE}(A) \\land \\forall B\\subseteq\\mathbb{N}\\;(\\mathrm{CE}(B)\\to B\\leq_m A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{m\\text{-}Complete}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{m\\text{-}Complete}(A)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>是多一完备的</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> : 可枚举集 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_m\">\\(\\leq_m\\)</span> : 多一可归约 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"87fbc479272c5469\" href=\"?note=87fbc479272c5469\" title=\"88-df-many-one-reducible\">88-df-many-one-reducible</a>)</li>\n<li>halting problem <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span>集的多一完备集</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-many-one-reducible","status":"resolved","id":"87fbc479272c5469","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-many-one-reducible]]","embed":false},{"target